{"suttaId":"tha-ap441","source":{"db":"E-Piṭaka (dhammanana/epitaka_app)","book":"Ap-ii","vriCode":"s0510m2.mul","paras":[762,788],"vripara":"72"},"segments":{"tha-ap441:0.3":"Ambapiṇḍiyattheraapadānaṃ","tha-ap441:1.1":"“Hatthirājā tadā āsiṃ, īsādanto uruḷhavā;","tha-ap441:1.3":"Vicaranto brahāraññe, addasaṃ lokanāyakaṃ.","tha-ap441:2.1":"“Ambapiṇḍaṃ gahetvāna, adāsiṃ satthuno ahaṃ;","tha-ap441:2.3":"Paṭiggaṇhi mahāvīro, siddhattho lokanāyako.","tha-ap441:3.1":"“Mama nijjhāyamānassa, paribhuñji tadā jino;","tha-ap441:3.3":"Tattha cittaṃ pasādetvā, tusitaṃ upapajjahaṃ.","tha-ap441:4.1":"“Tato ahaṃ cavitvāna, cakkavattī ahosahaṃ;","tha-ap441:4.3":"Eteneva upāyena, anubhutvāna sampadā.","tha-ap441:5.1":"“Padhānapahitattohaṃ, upasanto nirūpadhi;","tha-ap441:5.3":"Sabbāsave pariññāya, viharāmi anāsavo.","tha-ap441:6.1":"“Catunnavutito kappe, yaṃ phalamadadiṃ tadā;","tha-ap441:6.3":"Duggatiṃ nābhijānāmi, phaladānassidaṃ phalaṃ.","tha-ap441:7.1":"“Kilesā jhāpitā mayhaṃ … pe … viharāmi anāsavo.","tha-ap441:8.1":"“Svāgataṃ vata me āsi … pe … kataṃ buddhassa sāsanaṃ.","tha-ap441:9.1":"“Paṭisambhidā catasso … pe … kataṃ buddhassa sāsanaṃ”.","tha-ap441:10.1":"Itthaṃ sudaṃ āyasmā ambapiṇḍiyo thero imā gāthāyo Abhāsitthāti.","tha-ap441:11.1":"Ambapiṇḍiyattherassāpadānaṃ navamaṃ."},"attha":null,"tika":null,"tika2":null}
